<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine monthly vegoil/subproduct shipments.</title>
<headline>Argentine monthly vegoil/subproduct shipments.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentine Agriculture Secretariat October subproduct shipment figures, followed by January to October totals, in tonnes, (year-earlier in brackets):</p>
<p> Soymeal plts    869,688  (758,363)  6,960,481  (5,467,434)</p>
<p> Sunseed plts    153,976   (60,681)  1,682,746  (1,632,031)</p>
<p> Cotton plts	47,081   (25,377)    217,349    (241,069)</p>
<p> Linseed expls     6,061  (153,010)    110,604    (100,412)</p>
<p> Groundnut plts    7,005   (11,675)     42,349     (46,858)</p>
<p> Other plt/expl   65,624   (41,118)    168,601    (178,219)</p>
<p> Soybean oil     216,197   (95,910)  1,355,796  (1,117,761)</p>
<p>    Sunoil	 132,378    (48,113) 1,162,978   (1,135,713)</p>
<p>Principal destinations in October were as follows (tonnes):</p>
<p>SOYPELLETS: China 112,444; Holland 104,641; Italy 66,297</p>
<p>SUNPELLETS: Holland 113,950; South Africa 15,509; Britain 4,917</p>
<p>-- Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0668</p>
